        "text": "Financial stability of pension systems is essential for long-term economic well-being and social cohesion.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Government intervention in private pension structures is justified when systemic risks threaten large populations.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
