        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The Title I formula prioritizes funding based on poverty levels.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Students nationwide and in Virginia performed poorly on recent achievement tests.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Students missed significant time in school, primarily due to pandemic-related closures.",
