      },
      {
        "text": "There is some observable impact related to schools in the area.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker is asking about the effect on the average family in schools within their congressional district.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
