        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "School conditions have measurable consequences for families.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s role or position grants legitimacy to inquire about district-wide effects.",
        "confidence": 0.87
